<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cross-Continent cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cross-Continent cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Mark Husson downgraded Cross-Continent Auto Retailers Inc to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- cut 1997 earnings estimate to $0.84 from $0.98.</p>
<p>-- dropped 1998 view to $1.10 from $1.20.</p>
<p>-- late Wednesday the company said its earnings per share for the second quarter ending June 30 will be $0.07 below analysts' expectations of $0.25 cents.</p>
</text>
